Z||000002||Wolfhound||03-29-2001||09:16 AM||||Roy, We have communicated by email. I haven't met him but will make a point of doing so, He lives about 30 miles from here. He is also the webmaster for the Fiero Factory.<BR> I recognized the car in the photo. Check out the hood vents on the red metallic formula he sold, still one of my favorite executions. I believe it won best paint one year.<BR> I finished in Huntsville in time but I found the 84 SE in Atlanta and it had to be dealt with or lost. I would have loved to have been there and seen al those Fieros in on place and met you and the other forum members there. ||||reg||1
