Z||000004||Raydar||03-29-2001||03:49 PM||||Freddy IS an interesting guy. <BR>He'll probably be at Ed Parks' swap meet, at the end of April. The dark red Formula on his page is still one of the nicest Formulas I've ever seen. The pics don't do it justice. He sold it at the swap meet last year. Sold his T-top Formula (to me) the year before that.<BR>BTW... His fastback car (unless I'm mistaken) started life as a base 88 coupe. <BR>I believe that's the one he installed the 3.4 and an Isuzu tranny in.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
